## SQ-STL-02 | stepstool recipes and curios tag
@group A
@commands same; recipe + tag probe
@pass 16 `creativeengineering:shaped/*_stepstool` recipes (seat over `minecraft:oak_fence`); `#creativeengineering:stepstools` has 16, `#curios:feet` resolves to them; `/curios list` shows `feet`
